Fractional values are compared as numbers, not as text: `1.75` clears `1.5` while `1.25` does
not, and `10.5` clears `9.5` — the last of which a lexicographic comparison would reject.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/low/index.md --
---
title: Low
sp: 1.25
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/mid/index.md --
---
title: Mid
sp: 1.75
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/high/index.md --
---
title: High
sp: 10.5
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md' --where sp:gt=1.5 --output paths
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md' --where sp:gt=9.5 --output paths
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
plans/high/index.md
plans/mid/index.md
plans/high/index.md
